title AVG-07 Suspend, Reactivate or Delist a Service · PRD 2.8 · US-09
participant Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==SUSPEND==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:suspend (reason)
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:set Suspended first (calls rejected within 60 s; API keys kept)
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC (status on Zetrix chain)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Zetrix_Registry:hide listing + mirror
==REACTIVATE==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:reactivate (reason)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:if suspended by Zetrix, only Zetrix can reactivate
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:set Active
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert (old stays revoked)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Zetrix_Registry:show listing + mirror
==DELIST (PERMANENT)==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:delist (reason, typed service name)
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:revoke all API keys; set Delisted
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Zetrix_Registry:remove listing + mirror; deactivate did:oan
alt CLIENT TRIES TO LIFT A ZETRIX SUSPENSION
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin:Only Zetrix can reactivate this service.
end
alt SERVICE CERT REVOKE FAILS
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:service stays blocked in AVG; cert revoke failed, Retry
end
